OL,3,GNEWSASterling given suspended sentence 
OL,4,Afor dangerous driving                  
OL,6,FFormer England footballer Raheem       
OL,7,FSterling has been handed a suspended   
OL,8,Fsentence after he crashed his          
OL,9,FLamborghini.                           
OL,11,FThe 31-year-old, from Berkshire, gave  
OL,12,Fno reaction as he was sentenced to 12  
OL,13,Fmonths imprisonment, suspended for 18  
OL,14,Fmonths, at Basingstoke Magistrates'    
OL,15,FCourt for dangerous driving and        
OL,16,Fpossessing nitrous oxide on 28 May.    
OL,18,FSterling pleaded guilty in September to
OL,19,Fdriving a Lamborghini Urus dangerously 
OL,20,Fon the M25, the M3, the A327 and Minley
OL,21,FRoad.                                  
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
